// The overlook: a short exchange right after the camera pull-back, before the
// child chooses who leads. The hero is not chosen yet, so speakers are named
// directly (walid, nesma, fox).

=== before_choice ===
#speaker:walid #mood:surprised
Wow... look at it! The whole Kingdom of the Body!
#speaker:nesma #mood:thinking
It's huge. Where do we even start?
#speaker:fox #mood:happy
Yip! Yip!
#speaker:nesma #mood:happy
He's pointing at the trail down there.
#speaker:walid #mood:happy
Then let's go! But who leads the way?
-> END
